  "bodyHash": "5e775b590d481da1",
  "content": "<p><span style=\"font-family:trebuchet ms,geneva,sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"> <img src=\"http://i.imgur.com/gRq8PMf.png\" alt=\"Craftable Gunpowder\" width=\"1536\" height=\"512\"></span></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:'trebuchet ms', geneva, sans-serif;color:#f00\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">此模组已停止开发。感谢所有尝试过它的玩家。</span></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:trebuchet ms,geneva,sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">你是否一直觉得只有苦力怕和恶魂才会掉落火药？那么你来对地方了。本模组允许你制作手工火药。</span></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h2><span style=\"font-family:trebuchet ms,geneva,sans-serif\">1. 目录</span></h2>\n<ol>\n<li><span style=\"font-family:trebuchet ms,geneva,sans-serif\">目录</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family:trebuchet ms,geneva,sans-serif\">下载</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family:trebuchet ms,geneva,sans-serif\">安装</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family:trebuchet ms,geneva,sans-serif\">方块</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family:trebuchet ms,geneva,sans-serif\">物品</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family:trebuchet ms,geneva,sans-serif\">结语</span></li>\n</ol>\n<h2><span style=\"font-family:trebuchet ms,geneva,sans-serif\">2. 下载</span></h2>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:trebuchet ms,geneva,sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=http%253a%252f%252ffiles.minecraftforge.net%252fmaven%252fnet%252fminecraftforge%252fforge%252findex_1.8.9.html\" rel=\"nofollow\">Minecraft Forge</a></strong> (适用于 Minecraft 1.8.9)</span></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:trebuchet ms,geneva,sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=http%253a%252f%252ffiles.minecraftforge.net%252fmaven%252fnet%252fminecraftforge%252fforge%252findex_1.8.html\" rel=\"nofollow\">Minecraft Forge</a></strong> (适用于 Minecraft 1.8)</span></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:trebuchet ms,geneva,sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=http%253a%252f%252ffiles.minecraftforge.net%252fmaven%252fnet%252fminecraftforge%252fforge%252findex_1.7.10.html\" rel=\"nofollow\">Minecraft Forge</a></strong> (适用于 Minecraft 1.7.10)</span></span></p>\n<h2><span style=\"font-family:trebuchet ms,geneva,sans-serif\">3. 安装</span></h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-family:trebuchet ms,geneva,sans-serif\">本模组需要 <strong>Minecraft Forge</strong>，请先安装它。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family:trebuchet ms,geneva,sans-serif\">将下载的文件 <em>craftgun-1.x.x-mc1.x.x.jar</em> 移动到 <em>%appdata%/.minecraft/mods</em> 文件夹中。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family:trebuchet ms,geneva,sans-serif\">享受游戏吧！</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2><span style=\"font-family:trebuchet ms,geneva,sans-serif\">4. 方块</span></h2>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><span style=\"font-family:trebuchet ms,geneva,sans-serif\"><img src=\"http://i.imgur.com/TgCHYmi.png\" alt=\"Saltpeter Ore\" width=\"54\" height=\"54\"></span></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-family:trebuchet ms,geneva,sans-serif\">硝石矿</span></strong></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:trebuchet ms,geneva,sans-serif\">下界中非常常见的矿石。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:trebuchet ms,geneva,sans-serif\">可用任何镐挖掘，掉落 1 - 2 &times; 硝石。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:trebuchet ms,geneva,sans-serif\"><em>极易燃。</em><br></span></p>\n<br>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:trebuchet ms,geneva,sans-serif\"><img src=\"http://i.imgur.com/hGlwOiq.png\" alt=\"Sulfur Ore\" width=\"54\" height=\"54\"></span></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-family:trebuchet ms,geneva,sans-serif\">硫磺矿</span></strong></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:trebuchet ms,geneva,sans-serif\">下界中非常常见的矿石。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:trebuchet ms,geneva,sans-serif\">可用任何镐挖掘，掉落 1 &times; 硫磺。</span></p>\n<br>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:trebuchet ms,geneva,sans-serif\"><img src=\"http://i.imgur.com/3Xwm35w.png\" alt=\"Block of Saltpeter\" width=\"54\" height=\"54\"></span></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-family:trebuchet ms,geneva,sans-serif\">硝石块</span></strong></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:trebuchet ms,geneva,sans-serif\">用硝石填满 3×3 合成台即可制作。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:trebuchet ms,geneva,sans-serif\">也可以逆向拆解。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:trebuchet ms,geneva,sans-serif\"><em>易爆且极易燃。</em><br></span></p>\n<br>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:trebuchet ms,geneva,sans-serif\"><img src=\"http://i.imgur.com/AcCgklF.png\" alt=\"Block of Sulfur\" width=\"54\" height=\"54\"></span></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-family:trebuchet ms,geneva,sans-serif\">硫磺块</span></strong></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:trebuchet ms,geneva,sans-serif\">用硫磺填满 3×3 合成台即可制作。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:trebuchet ms,geneva,sans-serif\">也可以逆向拆解。</span></p>\n</div>\n<h2><span style=\"font-family:trebuchet ms,geneva,sans-serif\">5. 物品</span></h2>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><span style=\"font-family:trebuchet ms,geneva,sans-serif\"><img src=\"http://i.imgur.com/VLGGkqm.png\" alt=\"Saltpeter\" width=\"54\" height=\"54\"></span></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-family:trebuchet ms,geneva,sans-serif\">硝石</span></strong></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:trebuchet ms,geneva,sans-serif\">硝石矿的掉落物。</span></p>\n<br>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:trebuchet ms,geneva,sans-serif\"><img src=\"http://i.imgur.com/W8p2LxB.png\" alt=\"Sulfur\" width=\"54\" height=\"54\"></span></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-family:trebuchet ms,geneva,sans-serif\">硫磺</span></strong></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:trebuchet ms,geneva,sans-serif\">硫磺矿的掉落物。</span></p>\n<p><em><span style=\"font-family:trebuchet ms,geneva,sans-serif\">可用于酿造反胃药水。</span></em></p>\n<br>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:trebuchet ms,geneva,sans-serif\"><img src=\"http://i.imgur.com/GTsglyR.png\" alt=\"Crafting Gunpowder\" width=\"222\" height=\"108\"></span></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-family:trebuchet ms,geneva,sans-serif\">合成火药配方</span></strong></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:trebuchet ms,geneva,sans-serif\">要合成火药，你需要 1 &times; 木炭、2 &times; 硝石和 1 &times; 硫磺。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:trebuchet ms,geneva,sans-serif\"><em>合成台上原料的排列顺序并不重要。</em></span></p>\n</div>\n<h2><span style=\"font-family:trebuchet ms,geneva,sans-serif\">6. 结语</span></h2>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:trebuchet ms,geneva,sans-serif\">希望你能喜欢这个小模组。如果遇到任何错误信息，请在帖子中反馈。如果发现任何拼写错误，我很感激你的通知。我也欢迎任何建议或建设性的批评，以帮助改进模组或提升我的编程技能。如果你更倾向于使用 <a href=\"http://www.minecraftforum.net/forums/mapping-and-modding/minecraft-mods/2517581-craftable-gunpowder-v1-0-4-by-netglex\" rel=\"nofollow\">Minecraft 论坛</a>，你也可以在那里找到我的模组。<br></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:trebuchet ms,geneva,sans-serif\">我喜欢火绳枪，这也是我安装 <a href=\"https://minecraft.curseforge.com/projects/craftable-gunpowder-by-netglex/settings/1272627-balkons-weaponmod-v1-14#install\" rel=\"nofollow\">Balkon's WeaponMod</a> 的原因。不幸的是，如果我像自己那样过度使用火绳枪，会导致火药短缺。所以我决定开发一个模组来解决这个问题。</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:trebuchet ms,geneva,sans-serif\">如果你更喜欢通过 <a href=\"https://twitter.com/Netglex\" rel=\"nofollow\">Twitter</a> 联系我，请随时联系。</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:trebuchet ms,geneva,sans-serif\">- Netglex</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>",
